          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "аплодировать (aplodírovat) is a learned borrowing, usually traced through French applaudir to Latin applaudere 'to applaud' (Lewis & Short); EtymDB lists the verb without a source."
            }
          ]
        },
